          "thinking_parse": "closed_thinking",
          "final_text": "To find the percentage of Cabinets and Related Products' gross goodwill to the total gross goodwill as of December 31, 2010, I need to locate the relevant data in the annual report.\n\nFrom Note H (GOODWILL AND OTHER INTANGIBLE ASSETS), I can see the following information about gross goodwill as of December 31, 2010:\n\n| Segment | Gross Goodwill At December 31, 2010 |\n|---------|-----------------------------------|\n| Cabinets and Related Products | $587 million |\n| Plumbing Products | $536 million |\n| Installation and Other Services | $1,819 million |\n| Decorative Architectural Products | $294 million |\n| Other Specialty Products | $980 million |\n| **Total** | **$4,216 million** |\n\nThe gross goodwill for Cabinets and Related Products as of December 31, 2010 was $587 million.\nThe total gross goodwill as of December 31, 2010 was $4,216 million.\n\nTo calculate the percentage:\n($587 million / $4,216 million) × 100 = 13.92%\n\nSo, the percentage of Cabinets and Related Products' gross goodwill to the total gross goodwill as of December 31, 2010 is 13.92%.\n\nFINAL: 13.92",
