          "final_text": "To find the percentage change in total net goodwill between 2010 and 2011, I need to locate the net goodwill values for both years in the document.\n\nLooking at Note H: GOODWILL AND OTHER INTANGIBLE ASSETS, there is a table showing the changes in the carrying amount of goodwill.\n\nFrom the table:\n- Net Goodwill at December 31, 2011 = $1,891 million\n- Net Goodwill at December 31, 2010 = $2,383 million\n\nThe change in net goodwill = $1,891 million - $2,383 million = -$492 million\n\nThe percentage change = (Change / Old value) × 100\n= (-$492 million / $2,383 million) × 100\n= -20.65%\n\nTherefore, the percentage change in total net goodwill between 2010 and 2011 was a decrease of 20.65%.\n\nFINAL: -20.65%",
